mb|P|mb|P|mb|P|mb|1C|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Most players would open 1@D with the North hand. But I like 1@C much better. In general, with 4-4 in the minors, despite the conventional wisdom, I think opening 1@C is much better than opening 1@D unless your diamonds are much better than your clubs.|
